{"content":[{"c":["HELEZ"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of David’s valiant warriors, called a Paltite in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.26","r":"2Sam.23.26","rawR":"2Sam.23.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.26","value":"2Sam.23.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 23:26"}," and a Pelonite in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.27","r":"1Chr.11.27","rawR":"1Chr.11.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.27","value":"1Chr.11.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:27"},". The former is probably correct and refers to a person from Bethpelet. Most scholars think he is the same man as the officer in charge of the seventh course during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.10","r":"1Chr.27.10","rawR":"1Chr.27.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.10","value":"1Chr.27.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jerahmeel’s descendant from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.39","r":"1Chr.2.39","rawR":"1Chr.2.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.39","value":"1Chr.2.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:39"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Helez","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 23:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.26","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.26","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 11:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.10"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.39","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.39","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.39"}],"sourceItemFragment